## Product UX invariants (2026)

- **You (`/you`)**: settings list only — no goals hero, no duplicate score/net rows. Identity in avatar popover.
- **Settings**: Personal details merges income + email + city (`/you/personal`). No separate Money/Account rows on hub.
- **Ledger**: bills/spends at `/ledger/bills`, `/ledger/spends` — not `/money/*`.
- **Insights**: hub uses `PageShell`; breakdowns at `/insights/*`.
- **Cloud**: local-first; restore manual only (`cloud-sync-local-first.mdc`).

